        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ted Hutt, Jonathan Richmond\n- Albums: Back to the World\n- Bands: Street Dogs\n- Roles: Executive Vice President of A&R\n- Companies: Capitol Records\n- Radio Stations: WWBZ (103.5 FM, \"The Blaze\")\n- People: Whitney Houston, Elton John\n\nFacts:\n- Ted Hutt produced the Street Dogs album Back to the World.\n- Ted Hutt is the Executive Vice President of A&R at Capitol Records.\n- Jonathan Richmond was played on WWBZ (103.5 FM, \"The Blaze\") alongside Whitney Houston and Elton John.\n- Jonathan Richmond is not the Executive Vice President of A&R at Capitol Records.",
